> Not directly related to the post, but rather to la sutsis. How can changes
> be made to it? I entered my standard look-up word (whiskey) in the Eng-Loj
> section, and got only whiskey coffees. It turns out that the word "uiski"
> has as its definition "x1 is whisk(e)y distilled from x2." That "(e)"
> makes the word unfindable by normal search, and it makes "whisk" a separate
> 'word'.
>

You are supposed to edit via jbovlaste.lojban.org interface. la sutysisku (
http://mw.lojban.org/extensions/ilmentufa/i/en/index.html) uses jbovlaste
database and is often updated, either once a month or more often on demand.

However, I already fixed definitions of "whiskey". The la sutysisku app is
yet to be improved, e.g. glosses are not being searched. This will
hopefully be fixed another time.


> stevo
